{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18041","headline":"李花二首 一 · 韩愈","name":"李花二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平旦入西园，梨花数株若矜夸。\n旁有一株李，颜色惨惨似含嗟。\n问之不肯道所以，独绕百帀至日斜。\n忽忆前时经此树，正见芳意初萌牙。\n奈何趁酒不省录，不见玉枝攒霜葩。\n泫然爲汝下雨泪，无由反斾羲和车。\n东风来吹不解颜，苍茫夜气生相遮。\n冰盘夏荐碧实脆，斥去不御惭其花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18041.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18041","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}